<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks climb to record close again.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks climb to record close again.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks chalked up their fourth record close in five sessions on Monday as dealers bought ahead of predicted cuts in primary interest rates, traders said.</p>
<p>Preliminary figures put the leading IPC share index  .MXX up 23.67 points, or 0.62 percent, at 3,850.44 points.</p>
<p>((--Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
